1200 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Connors: Ah, Ms. Susanna... I originally contacted Mr. David because, as his\fan, I wanted to confirm some details with him in person. I never thought\you'd end up threatening to sue...":GOSUB 5100
1210 BM$="Connors: After our conversation, I contacted that person, and they said\they wanted to meet the two of you. What should I tell them?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6315:BM$="Susanna: Won't you tell us the name and occupation of this mysterious\person? I don't like meeting someone I know nothing of.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1230 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Connors: I'm afraid you'll have to find out once you see them. Besides, I'll be\coming as well. You have nothing to worry about.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1240 GOSUB 6315:BM$="Susanna: ...Alright then. Tell me where and when.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Connors: They're going to tell us the day of the meeting. I'm supposed to\pick you up at 9 and follow instructions. They're always busy so they can't\really arrange a meeting that easily.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 GOSUB 6315:BM$="Susanna: Isn't that strange? They want to meet us but won't even tell us\where... Very sketchy.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1270 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Connors: I'm inclined to agree, but they said there's no point in telling us\more unless you're sure about meeting them. So, what will it be?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 GOSUB 6315:BM$="Susanna: Hold on. I can't make the choice for David.":GOSUB 5100
1290 BM$="David wanted to know more about the Devil King, so he let Susanna know he\agreed.":GOSUB 5100
1300 BM$="Susanna: We're going. You'd better not be trying anything strange, or\we're going to sue the hell out of you and your mystery friend. Are we\clear?":GOSUB 5100
1310 COMMON FO:W2=0:GOSUB 6310:GOSUB 9010:BM$="Susanna put down the receiver. She looked worried.":GOSUB 5100:'
