1500 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: If this person is a descendant of the King of the North, we'd be\walking right into a trap. This could all be one big set-up...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1510 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: We'll never learn anything if we keep doubting them. I'm not\convinced I'm a descendant of the Devil King myself... Even if they're the\King of the North, they won't kill us on the spot.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1520 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: But you heard what King Hroth said... I wish we had a gun. We'll have\to make do with a knife.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1530 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: If the blood of the Devil King really flows in my veins, then that\power will protect me if we're in danger. I've been having nightmares for\so long, it's a miracle I haven't lost my mind. I need something to go on.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1540 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I... see your point. If anything happens, I'll be there for you.":GOSUB 5100
1550 BM$="David and Susanna were convinced that the person they were going to\meet was a descendant of the King of the North.":GOSUB 5100
1555 COMMON FO:GOSUB 5205:GOSUB 9525:GOSUB 5500:GOSUB 9020:'
1560 GOSUB 6120:BM$="The next morning, Connors came to pick them up; David however decided\to take his car as a precaution.":GOSUB 5100
1570 BM$="Connors told them that they would be going to the Red Lion restaurant in\Salisbury.":GOSUB 5100
1580 BM$="Before they left, Susanna said she forgot her purse, and rushed back\inside. She came back with her purse a few moments later, and got into\David's car.":GOSUB 5100
1590 GOSUB 6150:BM$="They took the M3 motorway, and then pulled off into the A30 road for\Salisbury.":GOSUB 5100
1600 BM$="Salisbury is the home of the famous megalith ruins, Stonehenge. Due to its\fame, it is common to find sightseeing buses from London.":GOSUB 5100
1610 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6140:GOSUB 9030:BM$="The two cars arrived at the Red Lion restaurant shortly after noon.":GOSUB 5100:'
1620 GOSUB 6130:GOSUB 6340:BM$="Connors glanced inside the restaurant, and then left to make a phone call.\It would appear that there had been some kind of miscommunication; he\was talking loudly, almost shouting.":GOSUB 5100
1630 BM$="After he hung up, he approached David and Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
